{
  "slug": "weilliptic-receipts",
  "name": "Weilliptic Receipts",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude Code plugin that audits AI-assisted code changes. Automatically records every file edit, session, and commit as a verifiable receipt providing tamper-proof provenance for AI-generated code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 command** and **6 hooks**.\n\n- **Commands** (1): `install-git-hooks` (Install Weilliptic git hooks for commit-time receipt persistence)\n- **Hooks** (6): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install weilliptic-receipts@claude-community` from `weilliptic-public/claude-code-hooks`.",
